WEBVTT

00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:04.845
A parent has seconds to find the right
entrance, but this pickup notice

00:00:04.860 --> 00:00:09.360
buries the answer in a paragraph, and
accessible pickup uses a different door.

00:00:09.640 --> 00:00:13.920
FROM HERE turns an existing notice into a
clear A3 sign.

00:00:14.300 --> 00:00:15.145
Upload a photo.

00:00:15.160 --> 00:00:19.260
The AI reads it and separates the audience,
action, place,

00:00:19.360 --> 00:00:20.840
time and any condition.

00:00:21.060 --> 00:00:23.720
You confirm these facts before the layout
changes.

00:00:24.040 --> 00:00:28.525
Here, we clarify child pickup, keep from
4:30 PM and preserve

00:00:28.540 --> 00:00:31.260
the main entrance for wheelchair accessible
pickup.

00:00:32.560 --> 00:00:35.680
The agent plans the hierarchy and renders
the artwork.

00:00:35.880 --> 00:00:40.325
Then a fresh AI read sees only that rendered
sign, without the original

00:00:40.340 --> 00:00:42.200
notice or expected answers.

00:00:42.440 --> 00:00:46.765
Code compares the recovered information with
your confirmed facts and checks that

00:00:46.780 --> 00:00:47.680
the text fits.

00:00:47.960 --> 00:00:50.060
The agent can adjust the layout twice.

00:00:50.200 --> 00:00:53.165
If it still fails, the final PDF stays
blocked.

00:00:53.180 --> 00:00:56.160
This real run passed on its first layout.

00:00:56.440 --> 00:00:59.640
Five fact groups recovered, including the
linked exception.

00:01:01.100 --> 00:01:02.880
Compare the original with the result.

00:01:03.060 --> 00:01:07.345
Download that same checked design as an A3
PDF or editable

00:01:07.360 --> 00:01:11.665
SVG. For a school office or reception desk,
this means producing a

00:01:11.680 --> 00:01:15.425
usable sign without rebuilding it in a
design tool, while keeping critical

00:01:15.440 --> 00:01:19.665
conditions visible. An optional two-second
exercise checks recall

00:01:19.680 --> 00:01:20.640
on this screen.

00:01:20.860 --> 00:01:22.345
Repeated attempts are practice.

00:01:22.360 --> 00:01:25.740
Automated checks do not certify human
readability.

00:01:26.240 --> 00:01:30.060
FROM HERE, a clearer sign with the important
details still there.
